          "id": "a1-03-l4-e03",
          "stage": "learn",
          "title": "Un solo i",
          "body": "Verbs in **-iare** keep only one i.\n\n| persona | studiare | mangiare |\n|---|---|---|\n| tu | stud==i== | mang==i== |\n| noi | stud==iamo== | mang==iamo== |\n\n> Not *studii* or *mangii*. The i of the stem and the ending become one.",
